data: {"id": "64bf51ffd0a0418e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1530", "run_id": "64bf51ffd0a0418e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口：\n\n## 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl`，UID `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`，Phase=Running，节点 `node2`\n- **容器**: `app`，image `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，command `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-dff5cbc6b`；**Service**: `workload` (selector 匹配)\n- **Volume**: ConfigMap `workload-code` 挂载为 `code`\n\n## 支持 CrashLoopBackOff 的事实\n1. **Kubernetes 状态**：containerStatus `app` 的 `ready=False`、`restarts=10`、`reason=", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789074130059, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

